							</span>
						</div>
						<div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-center rounded-md">
							<h6
								id="steph6-1"
								class="mb-0.5 text-base font-semibold text-white"
							>
								Tipo de empresa
							</h6>
							<p id="stepp-1" class="text-xs font-normal text-gray-400">
								Elige tu entidad comercial ¿No estás seguro? te ayudamos a
								elegir.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</button>
			</li>
			<li
				id="stepli-2"
				class="relative flex-1 after:absolute after:-bottom-12 after:left-1/4 after:inline-block after:h-full after:w-0.5 after:bg-gray-200 after:content-['']"
			>
				<button
					class="flex w-full max-w-sm items-center justify-center gap-8 text-left"
					id="paso2btn"
				>
					<div
						id="stepdiv1-2"
						class="group relative z-10 flex w-full items-center gap-3.5 rounded-xl border border-transparent bg-[#1d1d1d] p-3.5 transition-all hover:border-[#8c681d]"
